---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Breadcrumb from '../../components/Breadcrumb.astro';
import TestDataTable from '../../components/TestDataTable.astro';
---

<BaseLayout keywords="机场公开数据评估, 晚高峰公开数据评估, 节点表现参考数据, 网络延迟测试, 丢包率测试" title="网络测试数据 - ClashWiki 独立公开数据评估大盘" description="绝不云评测！ClashWiki 专属的网络测试数据大盘。我们公开所有参评机场的真实晚高峰延迟、丢包率与吞吐速度，用真实数据对抗虚假宣传。">
  <div class="fixed inset-0 z-[-1] pointer-events-none overflow-hidden bg-slate-50">
    <div class="absolute top-[-1< 1%] right-[-5%] w-[40vw] h-[40vw] rounded-full bg-emerald-500/5 blur-[120px] mix-blend-multiply"></div>
  </div>

  <div class="container mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 pt-28 pb-20 relative z-10">
    <Breadcrumb items={[{ label: '测试数据' }]} />
    
    <div class="mt-8 mb-12">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-100/50 text-emerald-700 text-sm font-medium mb-4 border border-emerald-200/50">
        <span class="relative flex h-2 w-2">
          <span class="animate-ping absolute inline-flex h-full w-full rounded-full bg-emerald-400 opacity-75"></span>
          <span class="relative inline-flex rounded-full h-2 w-2 bg-emerald-500"></span>
        </span>
        数据大盘实时在线
      </div>
      <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 mb-6 tracking-tight">
        网络测试数据库
      </h1>
      <p class="text-lg text-slate-600 max-w-3xl leading-relaxed">
        我们坚信，<strong>我们认为，缺乏可验证数据的评测很难真正帮助用户做出判断。</strong>。
        这里展示了我们在晚高峰时期（20:00 - 23:00），使用自费账号对各大网络服务商进行的真综合评估速抽样数据。绝不接受任何公关干预。
      </p>
    </div>
    
    <div class="bg-white/60 backdrop-blur-xl p-6 md:p-10 rounded-3xl border border-slate-200/60 shadow-xl shadow-slate-200/30 mb-12">
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 mb-12">
        <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 shadow-sm">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-emerald-100 flex items-center justify-center text-emerald-600 mb-4">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 8v4l3 3m6-3a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z" /></svg>
          </div>
          <h4 class="text-slate-900 font-bold mb-1">测试环境</h4>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-500">中国大陆电信/联通 1000M 宽带，晚高峰时段直连测试。</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 shadow-sm">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-teal-100 flex items-center justify-center text-teal-600 mb-4">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m5.618-4.016A11.955 11.955 0 0112 2.944a11.955 11.955 0 01-8.618 3.04A12.02 12.02 0 003 9c0 5.591 3.824 10.29 9 11.622 5.176-1.332 9-6.03 9-11.622 0-1.042-.133-2.052-.382-3.016z" /></svg>
          </div>
          <h4 class="text-slate-900 font-bold mb-1">无公关介入</h4>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-500">测试所用账号均为隐身随机购买，排除“特供满速线路”。</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 shadow-sm">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-indigo-100 flex items-center justify-center text-indigo-600 mb-4">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M4 7v10c0 2.21 3.582 4 8 4s8-1.79 8-4V7M4 7c0 2.21 3.582 4 8 4s8-1.79 8-4M4 7c0-2.21 3.582-4 8-4s8 1.79 8 4m0 5c0 2.21-3.582 4-8 4s-8-1.79-8-4" /></svg>
          </div>
          <h4 class="text-slate-900 font-bold mb-1">动态抽样</h4>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-500">仅展示各服务商代表性节点的抽样切片，数据不定期更新。</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      
      <TestDataTable />
      
    </div>
    
    <div class="text-center mt-8 text-slate-500 text-sm">
      <p>想要了解更多测试细节与评分权重？请阅读我们的 <a href="/methodology/" class="text-emerald-600 hover:underline">评分标准与方法论</a>。</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
